@startuml seq_auth
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "React SPA" as SPA
participant "FastAPI\n(REST API)" as API
participant "AuthService" as Auth
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Redis" as Cache

== Регистрация ==
User -> SPA : заполняет форму регистрации
SPA -> API : POST /auth/register\n{email, password}
activate API
API -> Auth : register(email, password)
activate Auth
Auth -> DB : INSERT INTO users
DB --> Auth : user
Auth --> API : user
deactivate Auth
API --> SPA : 201 Created {user_id}
deactivate API
SPA --> User : перенаправление на страницу входа

== Аутентификация ==
User -> SPA : вводит email и пароль
SPA -> API : POST /auth/login\n{email, password}
activate API
API -> Auth : login(email, password)
activate Auth
Auth -> DB : SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
DB --> Auth : user
Auth -> Auth : проверка password_hash
Auth -> Cache : SET session:{token} = user_id (TTL)
Auth --> API : JWT token
deactivate Auth
API --> SPA : 200 OK {access_token}
deactivate API
SPA --> User : сохраняет токен, открывает ЛК
@enduml